text = "I recently got into a... disagreement... with a certain snake, completely unrelated to you or anyone you know, I swear. The disagreement went... favourably for me and it was for the betterment of society, however, I sustained some damage affecting not only my staggeringly good looks. I have been on the run for some time now, and I would ask you not to disclose my presence here to the authorities, if you catch my meaning. But it has been costly to take care of this injury, so I am asking for reimbursement if possible."
